"><p>The bexio API uses HTTPS methods and RESTful endpoints to create, edit=
, and manage documents in the bexio system. JSON is used as the data interc=
hange format.</p>
<p>The bexio API allows you to build custom integrations and connect extern=
al applications to bexio. Please note that all usage of the bexio API is su=
bject to our <a href=3D"https://cdn.www.bexio.com/assets/content/documents/=
