 to include detailed steps allowing us to reproduce the issue. However, do =
not include any credentials in your report.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=3D&quot;https://help.bexio.com/s/contact-support?langua=
ge=3Den_US&amp;topic=3Dapi&quot;&gt;Report a problem&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please do note that the API is provided as is based on this very d=
ocumentation, there is no guided implementation or code support available.&=
lt;/p&gt;
"><p>If you've encountered a bug, we're here to help. Before you begin, ens=
ure you can reproduce the issue using a tool for testing APIs, such as Post=
man. To report the problem, please use the form provided below. Be sure to =
include detailed steps allowing us to reproduce the issue. However, do not =
include any credentials in your report.</p>
<p><a href=3D"https://help.bexio.com/s/contact-support?language=3Den_US&amp=
