guration">https://auth.bexio.com/realms/bexio/.well-known/openid-configurat=
ion</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Authorization endpoint</td>
<td><a href=3D"https://idp.bexio.com/authorize">https://idp.bexio.com/autho=
rize</a></td>
