<p>The scope <code>offline_access</code> is required to obtain a refresh to=
ken to keep the api connection alive.</p>
<ol>
<li>POST a request to the endpoint =E2=80=9C/token=E2=80=9D. Make sure you =
use the grant type =E2=80=9Crefresh_token=E2=80=9D. This is implemented acc=
ording to the standards of <a href=3D"https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6749#s=
ection-1.5"> OAuth 2.0 RFC 6749 </a></li>
<li>The response contains a new access token. Please note that the requeste=
d scopes do not change when refreshing a token. Acquiring new scopes is onl=
y possible by going through the initial authorization process again.</li>
<li>The new access token can be used to authorize requests and execute API =
requests</li>
<li>The bexio API responds with the requested data.</li>
</ol>
