&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;RateLimit-Limit&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The current limit for this time period.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;RateLimit-Remaining&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The remaining amount of requests allowed for this time period.&lt=
;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;RateLimit-Reset&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The remaining time until the next time period starts (seconds).&l=
t;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
