&lt;td align=3D&quot;right&quot;&gt;13600&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;manual_compound_entry&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;
Can be used to create a more complex booking where the total amount can be =
distributed among multiple accounts.
The following example shows how a received bank transaction can be booked o=
n multiple accounts:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;debit account&lt;/th&gt;
