&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
" class=3D"sc-iJKPHa sc-cCcVtu cJMweq ibOWPC"><p>Choose one of the followin=
g three types:<br><br>
<strong>manual_single_entry</strong><br>
